Cell["\<\
We define the following parameters (for the matching). The correct values for \
ruleA and ruleB can be taken from the documentation of GetDEQspt and \
GetDEQInf respectively.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.996982976136994*^9, 3.99698300874452*^9}, {
   3.997776305792548*^9, 3.997776390097816*^9}, 
