Cell["\<\
To check the derived precision we define a test coefficient where we know the \
value beforehand. 
A good candidate is is the coefficient of Log[z]/z^2\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9969830136854773`*^9, 3.9969830501810102`*^9}, {
  3.996983142797834*^9, 3.9969831449522123`*^9}, {3.997166566240843*^9, 
